OL,3,AOne dead and several hurt after
OL,4,Arollercoaster incident at Six Flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has died and several others
OL,7,Fwere injured after an incident on a
OL,8,Frollercoaster at Six Flags Over
OL,9,FGeorgia, an amusement park in the US
OL,10,Fstate of Georgia.
OL,12,FThe Cobb County Police Department said
OL,13,Fit was investigating the fatality at
OL,14,Fthe park, about 15 miles (24km) from
OL,15,FAtlanta, according to the BBC's news
OL,16,Fpartner CBS.
OL,18,FPolice did not specify what ride was
OL,19,Finvolved, but aerial footage from news
OL,20,Fhelicopters showed the Goliath
OL,21,Frollercoaster stopped midway, with
OL,22,Friders being helped off by workers.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
