OL,5,
OL,6,FSix Flags Over Georgia said it was
OL,7,F"deeply saddened by the guest incident
OL,8,Fat our park today. Our thoughts and
OL,9,Fheartfelt condolences are with the
OL,10,Fguest's family, friends, and loved
OL,11,Fones."
